{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When a number is tripled and then decreased by 6, the result is 15. The number is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfdc2d8aeb34b58dd1253d1f2db1236e8084e6ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the original number. Using the information given, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/3/f23ced1cc0449d0d95158584e3f98faf2283896a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x - 6 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/48133e11ad923083e3015d4a273e637470baa874.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = 15 + 6 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/eca86aaa386961ca40733d0e88458cd38f74481e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{21}{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"139\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Before being decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the number would have been <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff82e9f84bd6df9c6af21062cb33fd199f83b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 + 6 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Before being tripled, the number would have been <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/0/3a005c2f34ea16f82c1a4e3882c1aa9f6803807f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{21}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/189c90560f137a963025b7c3e0f0aa8c1b3d8625.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b>